        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                "word": "bravade",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ef20a299-aa37-42ef-9743-cb8466e9a13a",
                        "entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bravades"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                        "entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de braver ; paroles ou gestes de défi envers un individu ou un groupe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c1616fb-f876-4227-8318-e6d6242f5f71",
                                "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                                "text": "Vous les avez vus, vous les voyez quotidiennement, en guise de bravade contre l’application de la loi des associations aux ordres religieux, ouvrir avec fracas les chaires de nos églises aux membres des congrégations dissoutes, qui n’ont jamais eu le droit d’y monter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cabdad3b-6c11-4853-99b4-8c3f9d02c522",
                                "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                                "text": "L’agent voyer partit, sans vouloir dire adieu, presque décidé, par bravade, à payer sa bière."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96a9d78e-29e6-4156-8c60-16d8ced3c3f7",
                                "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                                "text": "Et puis, je tiens à manger ma côtelette, en ce jour de pénitence, non par bravade, mais pour vous signifier que j’ai gardé ma volonté intacte et que je ne céderai sur aucun point."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "334b221a-367d-4fc4-a242-ba7511720e4b",
                                "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                                "text": "Ils agissaient ainsi par bravade sans doute, mais nous savons que la bravade et le cynisme sont toujours une défense, plus ou moins consciente, contre le jugement d’autrui, le masque d’une honte secrète, une manière d’aller au devant d’un affront possible, de rendre terreur pour mépris."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24639d54-ba69-4f2c-a48e-947100d600c7",
                                "sense_id": "ba3d2312-0d05-38dd-8afa-754b0b057e32",
                                "text": "Il avait perdu ses cheveux mais, par bravade ou coquetterie, ne portait pas de perruque."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e462f37e-ac54-380b-94dd-c981874000d0",
                        "entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Feinte bravoure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f0865b2-e2eb-4792-bbc8-6b47c4ef61ae",
                                "sense_id": "e462f37e-ac54-380b-94dd-c981874000d0",
                                "text": "Votre cartel recevrait une prompte réponse, dit le pèlerin, si votre antagoniste était là ; mais, la chose étant comme elle est, ne troublez pas la paix de cette salle avec des bravades sur l’issue d’un combat qui, vous le savez bien, ne peut avoir lieu."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eca6d38f-1b90-416c-82d7-41bf2c69e32a",
                                "sense_id": "e462f37e-ac54-380b-94dd-c981874000d0",
                                "text": "Ces Gascons, dit Mazarin en riant, valent presque les Italiens pour la bravade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20bb0547-0f6e-4ddb-b121-85b149a5ddb8",
                                "sense_id": "e462f37e-ac54-380b-94dd-c981874000d0",
                                "text": "Au milieu de la catastrophe, Trump pérore tous les jours à la télévision, enfilant mensonges, approximations et bravades autosatisfaites, l’œil rivé sur son propre audimat et sur l’audience qu’il recueille sur les réseaux sociaux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb282f58-3365-3311-80f2-ad1dbfc62456",
                        "entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fête provençale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3f3d78e-5aa4-4dfa-ada5-a240d8973c65",
                                "sense_id": "fb282f58-3365-3311-80f2-ad1dbfc62456",
                                "text": "Il existe en vérité beaucoup de modèles de « fête traditionnelle » : du pèlerinage à la fête baladoire, de la bravade provençale à la kermesse flamande."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a72f28e-9fc8-429a-9b29-46c751084494",
                        "source_entry_id": "dc500896-1217-3074-8208-1d489f896198",
                        "target_lang_word": "bravado",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bravado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                        "entry_id": "aeb1c059-872c-3946-b914-e17094a11155",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A swaggering show of defiance or courage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ac2aaf-5fec-402b-a800-a73975f0b195",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "The angry customer stood in the middle of the showroom and voiced his complaints with loud bravado."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce95a490-6351-4c3a-bd0e-88e226495442",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "For a bravado he had the organ taken down and conveyed to his father's house, where he had it put up in the chamber where it now stands. It was also for a bravado that he played on it every day. But, by−and−by, the amount of time which he spent at it daily began to increase rapidly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdeab560-e8dd-4179-bcb0-92e1d6f34593",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "Rokoff assumed a truculent air, attempting by bravado to show how little he feared Tarzan’s threats."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "deed1eee-da09-4020-b245-ff11dc930f08",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "1990 Amy Longsdorf, K.T. Oslin: Personality, Wit and Style To Spare\", The Morning Callhttp://articles.mcall.com/1990-08-11/entertainment/2758085_1_oslin-country-music-kt\nSongs like \"Hey Bobby\", and \"Do Ya\" drip with innuendo and sexual bravado."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "519b0311-90b6-4faa-873e-13b2f8fc19cc",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "Stripped of all bravado, Cersei breaks, and shows the very scared, vulnerable woman who has kept her emotions at bay. “I don’t want to die,” she whimpers, “Not like this.” It’s all the more moving for coming from a character who built her identity on steely resolve and contempt for such hoary conceits as fear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b0c3282-91cc-4a99-a082-58f8f0b71ee8",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "The rise of SOS devices – satellite-synched gadgets that send a signal to rescue agencies when activated – give people bravado, Estrada says. “A lot of people carry these SOS devices and they think they can get into any trouble and they can get help,” he says, adding that he has seen more requests for assistance recently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19c75e8f-9ec5-45d9-a755-ad23807b5643",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "No doubt there is fear despite the bravado, but there is also no significant loss of Ukrainian military cohesion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8da4108-7bdb-4a6a-a7b9-f0f4d7d196a0",
                                                "sense_id": "fc50ebc1-6398-3111-ae52-05d94566d172",
                                                "text": "Behind the display of bravado, Trump must surely have sensed that his approach to foreign policy was catching up with him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6674fbd-b139-3b79-93a0-1fe5cdc0610e",
                                        "entry_id": "aeb1c059-872c-3946-b914-e17094a11155",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A superficial show of courage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4818e88-eb5d-3d87-86b9-faef5b29ad70",
                                        "entry_id": "aeb1c059-872c-3946-b914-e17094a11155",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A swaggerer; a braggart."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bravado",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8e134b9-0525-3220-ab98-009647e1b47b",
